{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-balance-pet#card-zh","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-balance-pet","commit":"17bc50c2bad31bdfdb313105d996e6ada4736046","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-balance-pet 是适用于 DSH Web 的 Windows 桌宠插件。它在 DSH 启动时开启本地余额代理并拉起桌宠，桌宠作为 Harness 窗口的附属窗口显示。主要功能包括定时获取 DeepSeek 账户余额、将余额显示在气泡中、跟随 Harness 窗口所在显示器定位，以及拖动、手动刷新和退出。适合希望在使用 DSH Web 时随时查看 DeepSeek 余额的用户。需要 DeepSeek API Key，可从环境变量或 DSH 凭据文件读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:37-74","lib/balance-server.js:23-49","src/DesktopPet.cs:430-499","src/DesktopPet.cs:538-566"]}
