{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-balance-pet#feature-1","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-balance-pet","commit":"17bc50c2bad31bdfdb313105d996e6ada4736046","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-balance-pet 的功能「余额气泡」：桌宠从本地余额代理取回 DeepSeek 账户总余额并显示在对话气泡中，长文本会自动缩小字号以适应单行。启动后定时刷新，也可双击或从右键菜单手动刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/DesktopPet.cs:334-365","src/DesktopPet.cs:538-605"]}
{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-balance-pet#feature-2","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-balance-pet","commit":"17bc50c2bad31bdfdb313105d996e6ada4736046","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-balance-pet 的功能「跟随 Harness 窗口」：桌宠附属于 DSH 窗口，在没有找到窗口或窗口最小化、隐藏时自动隐藏；显示时定位到该窗口所在显示器的右下角。用户可以拖动桌宠调整位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/DesktopPet.cs:430-499","src/DesktopPet.cs:507-535"]}
{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-balance-pet#feature-3","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-balance-pet","commit":"17bc50c2bad31bdfdb313105d996e6ada4736046","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-balance-pet 的功能「余额代理」：插件在 127.0.0.1 启动 HTTP 服务，由 /balance 返回余额数据，并提供 /health 健康检查。余额结果会短暂缓存，缺少密钥或请求失败时返回错误响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41-45","lib/balance-server.js:52-85"]}
{"unit_id":"Ho11ow8__deepseek-harness-balance-pet#feature-4","repo":"Ho11ow8/deepseek-harness-balance-pet","commit":"17bc50c2bad31bdfdb313105d996e6ada4736046","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-balance-pet 的功能「生命周期清理」：DSH 插件被 dispose 时会结束已启动的桌宠进程并关闭余额代理服务；桌宠在连续多次无法连接余额服务后会自行退出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:67-74","src/DesktopPet.cs:608-615"]}
